note Helper: unpack 8 nibbles from wReg (u32) against 8 SMEM floats at smOffReg + baseOff, accumulate into baccReg
fn uW4Mac8Smem wReg ulong smOffReg ulong baseOff ulong baccReg ulong to void
qic 58 40 smOffReg QZ baseOff qLd
qic 58 44 smOffReg QZ add baseOff 16 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qW4Unpack4 wReg 40 41 42 43 baccReg
qic 17 59 wReg QZ 16 qAlu4
qW4Unpack4 59 44 45 46 47 baccReg
end

note Helper: compute sum of 16 SMEM floats at smOffReg[0..63] -> sumReg
fn uSum16Smem smOffReg ulong sumReg ulong to void
qNum sumReg 0.0f32
for g ulong 4
qic 58 40 smOffReg QZ mul g 16 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qic 30 52 40 41 0 qAlu1
qic 30 53 42 43 0 qAlu4
qic 30 52 52 53 0 qAlu4
qic 30 sumReg sumReg 52 0 qAlu4
end
end

note Helper: select low or high 16-bit BF16 scale from sPackReg based on (lane & 2) != 0 -> dstReg
fn uPickBf16Scale2 dstReg ulong sPackReg ulong laneReg ulong to void
qic 18 52 laneReg QZ 2 qAlu4
qLit 53 1
qic 28 QZ 52 53 0 qCmp
qic 18 54 sPackReg QZ 0xffff0000 qAlu1
qicImm 8 dstReg sPackReg QZ 65536 qAlu4
put q36Guard 0 1
qicImm 8 dstReg 54 QZ 1 qAlu4
end

